imary suite offers his & hers closets and a 5-piece ensuite, plus 2 additional bedrooms, a 4-piece bath and laundry room. The finished basement adds a large rec room, 2-piece bath and extra storage. A/C, central vac and beautiful landscaping complete this wonderful family home. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$629,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","2"],["Living area","2,002 sq ft"],["Lot size","5,790 sq ft"],["Year built","2015"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Coloniale Estates"],["Town","Beaumont"],["Postal code","T4X1Z6"],["MLS® number","E4509071"],["Listed","September 17, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Central Vacuum, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, See remarks, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.29 m × 4.11 m (14'1\" × 13'6\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.08 m × 3.36 m (10'1\" × 11'0\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.29 m × 4.16 m (14'1\" × 13'8\")"],["Family room","Basement","3.85 m × 4.09 m (12'8\" × 13'5\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.42 m × 4.57 m (14'6\" × 15'0\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","3.84 m × 3.25 m (12'7\" × 10'8\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.13 m × 3.48 m (10'3\" × 11'5\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","3.07 m × 3.04 m (10'1\" × 10'0\")"],["Storage","Basement","3.69 m × 1.32 m (12'1\" × 4'4\")"]],"courtesy":"Christine Chorney, REMAX River City and Katie Thomas, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"beaumont","hood_slug":"coloniale-estates","area":""}